      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُطْعَمٌ</span></b>  [<i>Fed.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And hence,] (tropical:)  <i>Supplied with
the means of subsistence.</i> (S, K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [Hence,]
one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّكَ مُطْعَمٌ مَوَدَّتِى</span>, meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْزُوقٌ مَوَدَّتِى</span>
[i. e. (tropical:)  <i>Verily thou art gifted with my love,</i> or
<i>affection</i>]. (TA.)

